## 5.6 고차 함수 (Higher-Order Functions)

### 5.6.1 map

```julia
v = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
squared = map(x -> x^2, v)  # [1, 4, 9, 16, 25]
```

### 5.6.2 filter

```julia
v = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
evens = filter(x -> x % 2 == 0, v)  # [2, 4]
```

### 5.6.3 reduce

```julia
v = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
sum_result = reduce(+, v)  # 15
product = reduce(*, v)     # 120
```

### 5.6.4 fold (좌측/우측)

```julia
v = [1, 2, 3, 4]
result = foldl(-, v)       # ((1-2)-3)-4 = -8
result = foldr(-, v)       # 1-(2-(3-4)) = 2
```

