## 📝 요약

| 개념 | 문법 | 예 |
|------|------|-----|
| **if** | if 조건 end | if x > 5 println("큼") end |
| **if-else** | if...else end | if x > 5; "큼"; else "작음"; end |
| **삼항** | 조건 ? 참 : 거짓 | x > 5 ? "크다" : "작다" |
| **for** | for var in collection end | for i in 1:5; println(i); end |
| **while** | while 조건 end | while i < 10; i += 1; end |
| **break** | break | if i == 5; break; end |
| **continue** | continue | if i % 2 == 0; continue; end |
| **map** | map(func, collection) | map(x -> x^2, [1,2,3]) |
| **filter** | filter(func, collection) | filter(x -> x > 2, [1,2,3]) |
| **람다** | x -> expr | x -> x^2 |

